=Rocket Launcher=
*  Cost: %Minerals%15
*  [[concepts/initiative|Initiative]]: 100
*  [[concepts/vehicle|Weight]]: 3
*  Base [[concepts/scanning range]]: 5
*  Health: x2
*  Offensive turret
*  [[concepts/attack range|Base horizontal attack range]]: 4 (Missile)
*  Does not require ammunition
*  2 attacks per round
*  Explosion radius: 1
*  Damage: 7
This turret type can attack objects in range.
The Rocket Launcher turret intercepts hostile mobile units during their movement [[concepts/phase]]. It is thus particularly well suited to defend strategically important regions.
